# Fetched Slang binaries. Never committed: ~36 MB per RID, and reproducible from the pin in
# Directory.Build.props via `pwsh tools/fetch-native.ps1`.
runtimes/

# dotnet/Native/ IS committed. It is generated by tools/generate-native.ps1, but committing it
# keeps the repo buildable without the ClangSharp tool installed, and — more importantly — makes
# a Slang version bump show up as a reviewable diff. Vtable reordering is a silent ABI break;
# reviewing that diff is the control. See docs/binding-surface.md §4.3.

# TRX from the filtered validation-layer run in CI (ci.yml). A build artefact, not a result.
vulkan-results/
